    <dc:title>
      <rdf:Alt>
        <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">My name is Zen Nguyen. I was born in Vietnam, where movement was my first language. Before I ever picked up a camera, I was a dancer â€” learning how to tell a story with my body, how to command a room without saying a word. That instinct never left me. It</rdf:li>
        <rdf:li xml:lang="en">My name is Zen Nguyen. I was born in Vietnam, where movement was my first language. Before I ever picked up a camera, I was a dancer â€” learning how to tell a story with my body, how to command a room without saying a word. That instinct never left me. It</rdf:li>
      </rdf:Alt>
    </dc:title>
